<http://example.org/whu#ResearchStep> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nA paper-recorded research step (sampling, preprocessing, instrument run, statistical analysis), modeled as p-plan:Step.\n### Context\nCreate one node per concrete procedural step. Link:\n- isStepOfPlan → Collection|Preprocessing|BioChemicalExperiment|ComputationalExperiment\n- hasInputVar / hasOutputVar → Specimen|ProcessedSpecimen|DataSet\n- declaredUsed → Method|Device|Reagent|Software\n### Examples\n\"acid digestion\"; \"ICP-MS measurement\"; \"ANOVA of concentration data\".\n### Do not\nDo not create separate BioChemicalActivityStep / ComputationalActivityStep classes; use ResearchStep for all."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadMember> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "had member"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_DataItem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "IAO DataItem"@en .
<http://example.org/whu#DataSetService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#DataService> .
<http://example.org/whu#MPU> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Micropublication Argumentation Unit"@en .
<http://example.org/whu#EnvironmentFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Environment Feature"@en .
<http://example.org/whu#ResearchStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_InformationContentEntity> .
