<http://purl.org/mp#Claim> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nA scientific assertion (interpretive conclusion) argued in the paper.\n### Context\nExtract when text states main findings / conclusions that are supported or challenged by data/methods.\n### Examples\n\"mercury levels exceed safety thresholds\"; \"no significant contamination detected\".\n### Links\nClaim ← supports/challenges — ScienceEvidence | SupportGraph(Statement)."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#hasContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has context"@en .
