<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_InformationContentEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Information Content Entity"@en .
<http://purl.org/mp#Method> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Static protocol or standard defining experimental procedure."@en .
