<http://example.org/whu#ProcessedSpecimen> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nMaterial resulting from specimen preprocessing (digestion, filtration, homogenization).\n### Context\nOutput of Preprocessing steps; input to biochemical experimental steps.\n### Examples\n\"digested solution\"; \"filtered porewater\"; \"homogenized powder\".\n### Links\nResearchStep(Preprocessing) -hasOutputVar→ ProcessedSpecimen;\nResearchStep(Bio) -hasInputVar→ ProcessedSpecimen;\nProcessedSpecimen -wasDerivedFrom→ Specimen."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#declaredUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://example.org/whu#hasContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a specimen-collection plan to one or more environment features."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#Goal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_InformationContentEntity> .
