<http://example.org/whu#TargetAnalyte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Target Analyte"@en .
<http://example.org/whu#ScienceEvidence> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nIdentifiable composite evidence unit whose members include DataSet and Method.\n### Context\nCreate when data+method jointly support or challenge a Statement/Claim. Same DataSet/Method may join multiple ScienceEvidence.\n### Links\nScienceEvidence -prov:hadMember→ DataSet;\nScienceEvidence -prov:hadMember→ Method;\nScienceEvidence -mp:supports|mp:challenges→ Statement|Claim|SupportGraph.\n### Trace\nMember DataSet should connect back to ResearchStep via hasOutputVar."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_hasMeasurementValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://example.org/whu#ScalarMeasurementDatum> .
