<http://purl.org/mp#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_InformationContentEntity> .
<http://purl.org/mp#supports> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supports"@en .
<http://purl.org/net/p-plan#isPrecededBy> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "Define: Logical order between plans or steps (\"after\", \"then\", \"subsequently\").\nEBM order: SpecimenCollection precedes SpecimenPreprocessing; Preprocessing precedes BioChemicalExperiment.\nExamples: \"After preprocessing, ICP-MS was conducted\" → isPrecededBy(BioChemicalExperiment, SpecimenPreprocessing)."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#SupportGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Support Graph"@en .
