<http://example.org/whu#SpecimenCollection> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nA sampling/collection plan that produces Specimen from environmental context.\n### Context\nExtract when text describes field sampling, sample acquisition, collection sites/dates.\n### Links\nSpecimenCollection -hasContext→ EnvironmentFeature;\nResearchStep -isStepOfPlan→ SpecimenCollection;\nResearchStep -hasOutputVar→ Specimen.\n### Order\nSpecimenCollection precedes SpecimenPreprocessing (p-plan:isPrecededBy)."@en .
