<http://example.org/whu#DataSet> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nStructured dataset (table, figure, file, measurement collection) generated or used in research.\n### Context\nExtract when text names datasets/tables/figures/results that support or challenge claims.\nCreate ScalarMeasurementDatum for explicit numeric values and link via dct:hasPart.\n### Links\nResearchStep -hasOutputVar|hasInputVar→ DataSet;\nDataSet -dct:hasPart→ ScalarMeasurementDatum;\nDataSet -iao:is_about→ TargetObject|Specimen;\nDataSet ∈ ScienceEvidence via prov:hadMember;\nDataSet -mp:supports|mp:challenges→ Statement|Claim.\n### Examples\n\"Figure 4: MeHg accumulations…\"; \"Table 2 concentration results\"."@en .
