<http://example.org/whu#Reagent> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nReagent including concentration/unit/role when stated.\n### Examples\n\"HNO3\"; \"HgCl2 solution (~5 μg/g)\".\n### Links\nResearchStep -declaredUsed→ Reagent."@en .
