<http://example.org/whu#ScalarMeasurementDatum> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nSingle numeric value (± unit ± comparator/range) inside a DataSet.\n### Context\nCreate only for explicit numbers. Store value (iao:hasMeasurementValue), unit (iao:hasMeasurementUnit), comparator (whu:hasComparator).\n### Examples\n\"Hg = 12 mg/kg\"; \"MeHg < 0.2 ng/g\"; \"12–15 mg/kg\".\n### Links\nDataSet -dct:hasPart→ ScalarMeasurementDatum;\nScalarMeasurementDatum -iao:is_about→ TargetObject."@en .
<http://purl.org/mp#Statement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/whu#BioChemicalExperiment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_InformationContentEntity> .
<http://example.org/whu#SupportGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Argumentation structure targeting a single Claim; members are Statements and their support/challenge relations."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#SpecimenPreprocessing> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nPreprocessing plan: storage, transport, digestion, filtration, homogenization before analysis.\n### Context\nExtract cooling/freezing/filtering/digestion preparation procedures.\n### Links\nisPrecededBy SpecimenCollection;\nResearchStep -isStepOfPlan→ SpecimenPreprocessing;\nhasInputVar Specimen; hasOutputVar ProcessedSpecimen.\n### Order\nPreceded by SpecimenCollection; precedes BioChemicalExperiment."@en .
