<http://example.org/whu#ComputationalExperiment> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nComputational/statistical experiment: DataSet_raw → DataSet_final.\n### Context\nRisk assessment, ANOVA, regression, modeling. Has Goal targeting TargetVariable.\n### Links\nOften isPrecededBy BioChemicalExperiment;\nResearchStep -isStepOfPlan→ ComputationalExperiment;\nhasInputVar/hasOutputVar DataSet; declaredUsed Software|Method.\n### Examples\n\"health risk assessment\"; \"ANOVA of concentration across treatments\"."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#Software> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nSoftware tools for analysis or simulation (name + version if present).\n### Examples\n\"SPSS 26\"; \"R 4.2\"; \"MATLAB\".\n### Links\nResearchStep -declaredUsed→ Software (typically ComputationalExperiment steps)."@en .
<http://purl.org/mp#Statement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A proposition that can support or challenge a Claim."@en .
