<http://purl.org/net/p-plan#isStepOfPlan> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "Define: ResearchStep belongs to a Plan.\nConnect step → SpecimenCollection | SpecimenPreprocessing | BioChemicalExperiment | ComputationalExperiment.\nExamples: \"instrument run\" → isStepOfPlan(runStep, BioChemicalExperiment)."@en .
<http://purl.org/mp#challenges> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "Define: Evidence/data challenges a Statement or Claim.\nExamples: \"Findings contradict the prior claim\" → challenges(ScienceEvidence, Claim)."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_DataItem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/net/p-plan#correspondsToStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Optional link from executed prov:Activity to paper-recorded ResearchStep."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#DataSetService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dynamic service providing datasets via endpoint URL."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#TargetVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Estimated/modeled variable for ComputationalExperiment; align IAO/STATO."@en .
<http://example.org/whu#hasGoal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/whu#TargetObject> <http://example.org/whu#prompt> "### Define\nCore entity the experiment intends to investigate (pollutant, compound, estimated variable).\nPrefer subclasses TargetAnalyte (bio) or TargetVariable (computational).\n### Examples\n\"mercury\"; \"Hg content\"; \"cadmium\".\n### Note\nSpecimen = rice grains (carrier); TargetObject = Hg in rice (investigated entity)."@en .
